            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Draftava 1.3.6

- Adds a fast project switcher at the top of the sidebar, with remembered projects from different folders kept in a stable order.
- Makes project switching feel immediate, including instant popup dismissal and faster Open Project / New Project access.
- Improves spacing in the Idea editor and prevents Idea Shelf text drops from creating extra blank paragraphs.
]]></description>
